Modernize the game incrementally.

The preferred strategy is:

```text
Existing Engine
      ↓
Audit
      ↓
Stabilize
      ↓
Fix Core Runtime
      ↓
Fix Input
      ↓
Fix Player Control
      ↓
Modernize Game Loop
      ↓
Modernize Rendering
      ↓
Modernize Match Systems
      ↓
Modernize UI
      ↓
Improve Players
      ↓
Improve Stadium
      ↓
Improve Data
      ↓
