# 7. First Major Problem: Game Loop

Audit and modernize the game loop.

The game should have a predictable update model.

Prefer a structure conceptually similar to:

```text
while (running)
{
    processPlatformEvents();

    collectInput();

    updateGame(fixedDeltaTime);

    updateAnimation();

    updatePhysics();

    updateCamera();

    render();

    present();
}
```

Where appropriate, use a fixed timestep for gameplay/physics:

```text
Input
   ↓
Fixed Update
   ↓
Physics
   ↓
Gameplay
   ↓
Interpolation
   ↓
Rendering
```

Rendering FPS should not determine gameplay speed.

The game should behave consistently across different Android devices and frame rates.

