# 37. Performance

This is an Android game.

Performance must be considered throughout the modernization.

Measure before optimizing.

Track:

```text
FPS
Frame time
CPU time
GPU time where measurable
Memory
Texture memory
Draw calls
Shader switches
Loading time
```

Potential optimization areas:

* Frustum culling
* LOD
* Texture compression
* Batching
* Instancing where useful
* Resource caching
* Animation optimization
* Object allocation
* Avoiding unnecessary per-frame allocations
* Efficient update loops

Do not optimize code simply because it looks old.

Benchmark first.

