# 45. Definition of "Modernized"

The project should not be considered modernized merely because the UI looks better.

The modernization should exist at three levels.

### Technical Modernization

```text
Reliable game loop
Modern input system
Clear ownership
Stable lifecycle
Resource management
Testable systems
```

### Architectural Modernization

```text
Clear boundaries
Data-driven design
Modular systems
Platform abstraction
Rendering separation
Gameplay separation
```

### Visual/Gameplay Modernization

```text
Functional controls
Modern HUD
Better players
Better animations
Better stadium
Better pitch
Better lighting
Better match presentation
```

All three are required.

