# 46. Important Engineering Constraint

Do not turn the project into a giant enterprise architecture.

This is a game engine.

Avoid unnecessary:

```text
FactoryFactory
ManagerManager
AbstractAbstractPlayer
10-layer dependency injection
Excessive interfaces
Unnecessary ECS implementation
Microservices
Unnecessary scripting systems
```

Use abstractions where they solve real problems.

Prefer:

```text
Simple
Explicit
Fast
Testable
Readable
Maintainable
```

over:

```text
Highly abstract
Highly generic
Difficult to debug
Difficult to modify
```

